	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Cum hac transiret ornatissimus et humanissimu<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>s vir d. <persName ref="p944">Morellius</persName> literas a tua human<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>itate scriptas non reddidit: rediens autem <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> reddidit.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Imposuerat enim sarcinae, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quam aperuit tandem in <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName>; ita <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>factum est, ut in primo congressu nihil dederit.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Caeterum facile ei errorem hunc con<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>donavi, quod neuter hic ullam fecerit iacturam.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Carui quidem gaudio hactenus, quod tamen <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>cumulatius nunc me beavit, qui intelligo, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>tuam pietatem conari aliquid.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Perge, mi domi<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ne et frater.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Dominus concedat spiritum suum <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>sanctum tibi, ut conatus hic tuus cedat ad gloriam <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>dei et multorum salutem.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Expecto nunc <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>cum desiderio sanctos tuos labores: sed vide <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ne festines, et cum molestia aliqua scribas.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Scio te multis oppressum negotiis vix omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>sustinendis sufficere.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Moderate ergo ex<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ercebis afflictas alioqui vires.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/><persName ref="p8101">Laelius</persName>, ut scribebas, rediit ad nos, et nunc inter <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>nos habitat.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Modeste se gerit.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Compesco ego, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>quantum possum, hominis curiositatem.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Idem faciunt <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>symmystae reliqui, ut minus sit molestus nobis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Valet <persName ref="p1911">Leverus</persName>, valent <placeName ref="l830">Angli</placeName> reliqui peroptime, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>deo gratia, sed non im<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>merito immoderate affliguntur <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ingratitudine miserae <placeName ref="l830">Angliae</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Recepisse <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>illa scis <persName>Hispanum</persName>, qui gubernationem suam sanguin<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>e iniciavit, truncatis duobus nobilibus.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Metuunt ne iam sublati sint sanctissimi illi episcopi <lb xml:id="p1z31"/><persName ref="p7623">Latimerus</persName>, <persName ref="p674">Cranmerus</persName>, <persName ref="p21391">Ridleus</persName>, <persName ref="p1560">Hopperus</persName>, etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Orandum <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>nobis video assidue pro ecclesia illa afflictissima.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>D. <persName ref="p974">Molinaeus</persName> hanc schedam ad me misit, orans ut <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>per proximum ad te nuncium eam mitterem.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Hodie <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>mihi est reddita.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Intelligo illum non mansurum <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>diu <placeName ref="l512">Tubingae</placeName>, sed inde migraturum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>C[aus]a fidelium <placeName ref="l294">Locarnensium</placeName> iam agitur in comitiis <placeName ref="l21">Ba<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>densibus</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Nisi vero dominus gratia sua affulserit, dubito <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>de felici rerum eventu.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Nam vel amica <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>transactione, vel iure cum 7 rebuspublicis agendum <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>erit 4 urbibus.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">At tanta est illorum hominum [<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>barbaries ferocia et]<note type="misc">gestrichen.</note> durities, ut metuam <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>bonis.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Video nostros satis esse sedulos: sed interim experior <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>i<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>n diem illorum malitiam* esse insuperabilem<note type="misc">mal. gestrichen umd mit duritiem überschrieben.</note>.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Dominus ecclesiae suae assertor et liberator oppressorum <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>adsit nobis perpetuo.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Ubi de illis comitiis, quae <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>nondum finita sunt, certum aliquid habuero, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>mature significabo<note type="misc">ganzer Satz gestrichen.</note>.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum omnibus fratribus et symmystis, et orate pro nobis dominum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> festinantissime 15<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>54. septembris 9.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Tuus <persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p540">Ioanni Calvino</persName> <placeName ref="l167">Genevensis</placeName> e<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>cclesiae pastori fidelissimo domino honorando et fra<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>tri charissimo suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
